WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.000
The chaos of origin!

00:03.160 --> 00:06.020
Already doing kenpou practice so early in the morning?

00:06.540 --> 00:07.420
Sensei.

00:08.020 --> 00:09.050
Chisame-san...

00:09.490 --> 00:10.450
Here.

00:17.670 --> 00:18.610
What's this...?

00:19.240 --> 00:24.290
They say it's a scroll that Evangeline used to once write down "Magia Erebea."

00:27.760 --> 00:31.650
This isn't just any old spell scroll, right?

00:35.840 --> 00:38.700
"If you choose the path of light, don't open it."

00:38.700 --> 00:41.820
"But if you choose the path of darkness, try opening it." That's what he said.

00:44.490 --> 00:45.740
Well...

00:47.220 --> 00:50.500
Your heart has probably already decided, right?

00:50.920 --> 00:52.970
Geez... what a reckless conclusion.

00:56.250 --> 00:59.800
Even so, I'm supposed to be looking out for you...

01:00.190 --> 01:01.800
Even I know that.

02:47.210 --> 02:48.230
Yo, kid!

02:51.050 --> 02:53.730
How is it? Have you decided?

02:54.180 --> 02:55.070
Yes.

02:55.330 --> 02:58.150
So, Light or Darkness. Which is it?

02:58.630 --> 02:59.650
Yes...

03:03.770 --> 03:06.910
<i>I see. He's taking his Father's Path after all.</i>

03:07.480 --> 03:09.340
<i>Well, that works too.</i>

03:10.180 --> 03:13.000
I'm sorry, Chisame-san.

03:13.000 --> 03:16.950
I guess this decision may well be reckless.

03:19.260 --> 03:20.870
What was that, Sensei?

03:20.870 --> 03:22.940
You're still worried about that?

03:23.520 --> 03:28.520
You won't know if something is right or wrong until you've tried it.

03:28.520 --> 03:31.670
And it's a huge decision too, so I don't really know...

03:31.920 --> 03:36.430
But it's a path that you need to choose for yourself.

03:37.490 --> 03:40.440
It's one step that you have to take by yourself.

03:41.210 --> 03:43.360
It's got nothing to do with being reckless.

03:43.360 --> 03:45.200
Just put your heart to it.

03:45.200 --> 03:49.590
I'll... see it with my own eyes anyway.

03:50.380 --> 03:51.710
Thank you very much.

03:52.160 --> 03:53.260
<i>That's right.</i>

03:53.260 --> 03:54.950
<i>My heart has already decided.</i>

03:59.760 --> 04:01.580
<i>The conclusion I reached after consideration...</i>

04:02.310 --> 04:04.230
<i>I may be wrong.</i>

04:04.230 --> 04:06.500
<i>And I might be consumed by the darkness.</i>

04:06.950 --> 04:09.220
<i>But... But even so...</i>

04:09.680 --> 04:13.000
<i>In order for me to be able to walk with everyone from now on...</i>

04:13.000 --> 04:14.840
<i>and for me to be able to reach my father...</i>

04:15.400 --> 04:16.480
<i>I will risk it!</i>

04:17.220 --> 04:21.240
Rakan-san, I choose Darkness!

04:25.220 --> 04:26.970
This is unexpected.

04:26.970 --> 04:30.520
But, kid, what happened to aiming for your father's path?

04:30.910 --> 04:33.030
I'm not my father.

04:33.030 --> 04:35.780
Even if I try to act cool, I won't become like my father.

04:36.640 --> 04:40.920
If I have some dark elementary attainments, I think that unless I investigate that,

04:41.530 --> 04:43.800
I won't be able to reach my father.

04:47.270 --> 04:48.340
And I...

04:49.270 --> 04:51.560
I also really like Master.

05:00.820 --> 05:02.030
That's good!

05:02.580 --> 05:05.100
Nice love confession, kid.

05:06.290 --> 05:08.400
No, that's not what I meant.

05:09.850 --> 05:12.410
But you've taken Darkness lightly, kid.

05:12.690 --> 05:17.410
Once the scroll is opened, what comes next is really hard, you know?

05:18.030 --> 05:19.750
I also know that.

05:20.140 --> 05:22.420
This scroll isn't ordinary.

05:23.250 --> 05:25.010
I'm prepared for it.

05:25.010 --> 05:26.410
I will overcome this!

05:26.760 --> 05:28.700
You've said it, brat.

05:31.890 --> 05:32.760
What?!

05:47.960 --> 05:52.200
You should realize that Darkness isn't that easily dealt with.

05:52.490 --> 05:53.350
Master!

06:00.130 --> 06:01.850
Try and overcome it.

06:01.850 --> 06:04.400
If you can't, this will be the end for you!

06:04.420 --> 06:06.500
W-What on earth is going on?!

06:06.500 --> 06:07.420
Why is she...?!

06:07.700 --> 06:09.700
Didn't I tell you? It'll be hard.

06:24.650 --> 06:26.370
It's no good, it's collapsing!

06:26.370 --> 06:28.750
Run, run! We'll be buried alive!

06:29.400 --> 06:32.570
Who would've thought there'd be such a clichéd trap at the end!

06:32.570 --> 06:34.530
Are you alright, Miss?

06:34.790 --> 06:35.430
Yes!

06:35.790 --> 06:37.480
Look! It's the exit!

06:37.480 --> 06:38.540
We've done it!

06:45.000 --> 06:46.440
That was dangerous...

06:46.850 --> 06:49.960
I never thought the ruins would completely collapse.

06:52.300 --> 06:53.720
I thought I was going to die...

06:54.370 --> 06:56.310
Are you okay, Nodoka?

06:56.650 --> 06:57.810
Y-Yes.

06:58.570 --> 07:01.600
But you really have gotten stronger.

07:02.020 --> 07:07.360
When we found you in the ruins and you asked to join us, I was really wondering what to do.

07:07.360 --> 07:11.850
Yup yup. Nodoka-chan's trap detecting skills are first rate!

07:12.850 --> 07:13.870
Usable.

07:14.420 --> 07:17.950
Where did you learn that skill at that age?

07:21.600 --> 07:24.380
Um... at a club activity?

07:24.570 --> 07:25.380
Eh?

07:26.050 --> 07:30.210
Alright! It's finally time to divide the treasure!

07:30.610 --> 07:32.970
It's a big haul for all our hard work!

07:35.180 --> 07:38.290
Miss, are you sure you don't want any treasure?

07:38.290 --> 07:40.260
There's no need to hold back.

07:40.670 --> 07:42.110
No, there's no need.

07:42.510 --> 07:44.750
This is plenty for me.

07:45.560 --> 07:48.280
It'd probably cost a lot to buy too...

07:50.490 --> 07:54.000
Hmm, so this is the magic item that you were searching for?

07:54.000 --> 07:57.860
Yes, finally. And it's thanks to everyone!

07:58.900 --> 08:01.620
<i>A magic tool that allows me to see into an opponent's mind and learn their name.</i>

08:01.620 --> 08:03.710
<i>Comptina Daemonia</i>

08:01.620 --> 08:03.710
<i>[Demon's Lullaby]</i>

08:04.500 --> 08:06.800
<i>Though it sounds a bit evil.</i>

08:33.530 --> 08:36.450
To have such mobility despite having a body that's over 20 meters...

08:36.450 --> 08:38.850
And to have such a crazy amount of stamina...

08:39.070 --> 08:42.490
I see that dragons are really fierce creatures de gozaru.

08:42.490 --> 08:43.260
However...!

08:50.000 --> 08:51.170
Kaede Ninpou:

08:51.170 --> 08:52.990
Binding Chain Explosive Battle Formation

08:51.170 --> 08:52.990
Bakusa Bakuenjin

08:59.450 --> 09:01.430
Naumac Samanda Vajuradan Kaan

09:08.970 --> 09:10.370
What was that?

09:10.370 --> 09:11.730
Kaede!

09:13.650 --> 09:18.140
Could it be that Kaede was beaten by that black dragon?

09:20.440 --> 09:22.040
There's no need to worry.

09:28.080 --> 09:31.380
Black dragon extermination complete de gozaru.

09:32.380 --> 09:33.620
Kaede!

09:34.140 --> 09:37.080
It seems I may have gone a bit overboard de gozaru.

09:37.330 --> 09:40.930
I've got it. I'll heal it!

09:41.810 --> 09:43.300
I'm grateful.

09:43.300 --> 09:46.060
Ah, but make sure you don't heal the horn!

09:46.380 --> 09:47.550
Come!

09:46.380 --> 09:47.550
Adeat!

09:48.380 --> 09:49.970
Fan of the Eastern Wind

09:48.380 --> 09:49.970
Kochi no Hiougi

09:50.260 --> 09:51.700
Fan of the Southern Wind

09:50.260 --> 09:51.700
Hae no Suehiro

09:53.790 --> 09:56.570
She's healing something with such a large body...

09:56.980 --> 09:58.570
Amazing de gozaru...

10:01.470 --> 10:04.630
Oh no! Now that it's healed, will it go on a rampage again?

10:04.630 --> 10:05.860
Konoka-dono! Get ba-

10:07.450 --> 10:10.000
Don't do bad things anymore.

10:11.140 --> 10:12.210
Okay?

10:16.090 --> 10:18.220
Take care!

10:18.470 --> 10:22.710
In any case, we broke off the dragon's horn as requested,

10:23.240 --> 10:26.850
so it won't be returning until next year when the horn has regrown de gozaru.

10:27.410 --> 10:28.520
Return.

10:27.410 --> 10:28.520
Abeat.

10:29.580 --> 10:32.860
But wow, Konoka-dono, you're really amazing de gozaru.

10:33.370 --> 10:35.220
Eh? What's with that?

10:35.220 --> 10:37.580
Nothing's going to happen if you praise me, you know.

10:37.580 --> 10:39.480
And if that's how you want to talk, what about you?

10:39.480 --> 10:42.990
Fighting a dragon while blindfolded?

10:43.510 --> 10:46.750
No, it's just training for me.

10:48.710 --> 10:52.500
No... I still have a long way to go at the moment.

10:54.860 --> 10:56.760
Kaede, you got hurt too!

10:57.070 --> 10:58.530
I'll patch you up!

11:00.850 --> 11:06.050
Konoka-dono's ability in recovery spells is also rising noticeably.

11:13.150 --> 11:15.400
Opening gate! Opening gate!

11:16.490 --> 11:18.400
They're back!

11:20.560 --> 11:23.110
Hey, isn't that the black dragon's horn?

11:24.240 --> 11:26.540
Good work, you two!

11:26.540 --> 11:30.000
Slit-eyed girl, you're a real ninja as rumored after all, aren't you?

11:30.210 --> 11:35.080
In comparison, these rogues staying at my place are useless!

11:35.080 --> 11:37.190
Give us a break milady!

11:37.190 --> 11:38.420
It was a black dragon!

11:38.420 --> 11:45.540
Well, we were only able to defeat one of the two dragons that were attacking the village...

11:45.960 --> 11:47.500
It's fine, it's fine!

11:47.500 --> 11:53.330
It seems that a traveling duo of bounty hunters has already taken care of the other one!

11:53.330 --> 11:54.980
We're already safe.

11:56.380 --> 11:58.220
Be sure to drop by my place later!

11:58.220 --> 12:01.310
I'll cook the best food of the borderlands for you as a treat!

12:01.850 --> 12:04.410
It sure is mysterious de gozaru.

12:04.730 --> 12:08.160
In the old world, my power was of no use to anyone.

12:08.160 --> 12:11.060
However, here, it is able to bring people such happiness.

12:11.060 --> 12:12.880
Right, Konoka-dono?

12:13.420 --> 12:14.080
Konoka-dono?

12:18.060 --> 12:22.340
It's rare to see you looking so depressed, Konoka-dono.

12:23.340 --> 12:26.340
I'm not really...

12:26.340 --> 12:27.640
It'll be fine!

12:27.640 --> 12:32.270
Negi-bouzu was fine. I'm sure Setsuna-dono and Asuna-dono are too!

12:32.470 --> 12:34.080
Cheer up de gozaru!

12:34.080 --> 12:36.520
Just cheer up already!

12:36.520 --> 12:40.320
Even though it's certain that Ojou-sama is in this region,

12:40.320 --> 12:42.180
we're still here wasting our time taking out dragons.

12:42.180 --> 12:45.730
It's fine. This horn sells for a quite a lot.

12:53.560 --> 12:54.210
Kono...

12:54.210 --> 12:56.210
Secchan!

12:56.530 --> 12:57.490
Kaede-chan!

12:57.490 --> 12:58.950
Asuna-dono, you're safe!

12:59.200 --> 13:02.370
Secchan... Secchan! I missed you!

13:02.370 --> 13:04.220
Oj-Ojo-Oj-Ojou-sama!?

13:04.590 --> 13:07.070
And Asuna is safe as well! Thank goodness!

13:06.610 --> 13:08.720
Come on Konoka, calm down!

13:09.090 --> 13:12.720
And now, the Negima Club is now up to four members again!

13:13.840 --> 13:15.600
I don't really know what's going on, but congrats!

13:15.600 --> 13:16.330
Congrats!

13:17.350 --> 13:18.560
I thought as much!

13:20.730 --> 13:23.320
Asuna-dono has increased her skill, hasn't she de gozaru?

13:23.820 --> 13:25.180
So you can tell, Kaede?

13:25.180 --> 13:28.150
She got stronger after hunting bounties and taking down magical beasts.

13:28.750 --> 13:33.700
Not to mention defeating hunters that came after the bounty on our heads.

13:35.460 --> 13:36.620
Alright!

13:36.620 --> 13:40.070
All that's left is to meet up with Negi and everyone else!

13:53.100 --> 13:55.590
Dammit! His fever won't go down!

13:56.210 --> 13:58.310
It's just like before!

13:58.620 --> 14:00.560
What the hell did that woman do?!

14:00.810 --> 14:02.560
Actually, where did she go?

14:02.880 --> 14:04.210
That woman?

14:04.690 --> 14:06.010
You mean that pseudo-Eva?

14:07.410 --> 14:09.000
That was a degraded copy of Eva.

14:09.790 --> 14:11.110
An artificial soul.

14:11.630 --> 14:13.610
It's probably inside the kid right now.

14:14.090 --> 14:17.120
This is likely the test to be able to use Dark Magic.

14:17.830 --> 14:22.250
If he can't overcome this trial, he may never wake up again...

14:22.780 --> 14:28.080
Or at the very least, he will no longer be able to use Magic.

14:29.480 --> 14:31.300
I never heard any of this!

14:31.590 --> 14:33.050
You knew yet you-

14:32.470 --> 14:34.790
This is the unfair way.

14:35.750 --> 14:37.770
You should've been prepared for something like this, right?

14:41.530 --> 14:42.180
Dammit...

14:50.010 --> 14:51.520
Where am I...?

14:52.550 --> 14:53.530
Prepare yourself.

14:56.040 --> 14:57.990
Prepare yourself or you'll die!

14:58.430 --> 14:59.410
Master!

14:59.750 --> 15:01.620
This will be the death of your soul!

15:06.120 --> 15:08.960
Oh? Ensis Exsequens, huh?

15:06.120 --> 15:08.960
[Executioner's Sword]

15:08.960 --> 15:10.800
So you're trying to copy me?

15:12.130 --> 15:16.640
I see. That was your intention from the beginning, isn't it?

15:17.750 --> 15:18.560
You fool.

15:26.290 --> 15:29.530
To think there's someone foolish enough to choose Darkness by their own will.

15:29.840 --> 15:30.840
The location...!

15:30.840 --> 15:32.570
No... Calm down...

15:32.570 --> 15:34.660
This is probably all in my head.

15:35.060 --> 15:37.410
That won't be the real Master.

15:37.620 --> 15:39.340
What is Darkness, boy?

15:39.860 --> 15:41.740
The Shadow that opposes Light.

15:41.740 --> 15:43.160
The Night that opposes Day.

15:43.160 --> 15:44.440
Right and Wrong.

15:44.440 --> 15:45.730
Good and Evil.

15:45.730 --> 15:47.130
Order and Chaos.

15:47.130 --> 15:48.360
Reason and Irrationality.

15:48.720 --> 15:53.520
But what you really need here is a much simpler power.

15:53.520 --> 15:55.510
Lic Lac La Lac Lilac

15:55.510 --> 15:57.970
Come, Spirits of Ice!

15:55.510 --> 15:57.970
Veniant Spiritus Glaciales!

15:57.970 --> 16:00.290
Spread forth into the air!

15:57.970 --> 16:00.290
Extentantur Aeri!

16:00.290 --> 16:02.320
Tundra and Glacier,

16:00.290 --> 16:02.320
Tundram et Glaciem

16:02.320 --> 16:04.300
in the Realm of White Night!

16:02.320 --> 16:04.300
Loci Noctis Albae!

16:04.300 --> 16:07.180
Frozen Earth!

16:04.300 --> 16:07.180
Crystallizatio Tellustris!

16:11.250 --> 16:15.030
This is the Darkness of Beginning that consumes everything.

16:15.030 --> 16:17.600
This is a black hole that consumes everything; the darkness of origin.

16:17.620 --> 16:19.500
Lic Lac La Lac Lilac

16:19.500 --> 16:21.570
Come forth, Spirits of Ice and Air!

16:19.500 --> 16:21.570
Veniant Spiritus Glaciales Aeriales!

16:22.550 --> 16:23.850
Avalanche!

16:22.550 --> 16:23.850
Nivis Casus!

16:26.460 --> 16:31.260
If you can't understand what I mean, you'll be destroyed by me here and now.

16:31.260 --> 16:32.070
Die!

16:33.080 --> 16:35.920
The Darkness of Beginning that consumes everything.

16:36.230 --> 16:37.150
<i>Calm down!</i>

16:37.150 --> 16:41.890
<i>This master is nothing more than an illusion created from an image in my memories.</i>

16:41.890 --> 16:43.500
<i>In other words, my "shadow."</i>

16:43.500 --> 16:44.810
<i>If it's my image, then...</i>

16:45.820 --> 16:47.130
<i>My image of Master...</i>

16:47.590 --> 16:49.200
<i>Image of Master...</i>

16:50.100 --> 16:51.870
<i>Image...</i>

16:52.320 --> 16:53.560
<i>There's no way I can win!</i>

16:53.820 --> 16:58.320
Though you should have already realized what that means.

16:58.560 --> 16:59.060
Huh?

17:29.230 --> 17:30.930
Explosive Cun Jin

17:29.230 --> 17:30.930
Bao Rie Tsun Jin

17:33.220 --> 17:35.740
Crap! I forgot where I was standing!

17:40.390 --> 17:41.330
Shundou...

17:42.120 --> 17:42.950
Shundou...

17:44.310 --> 17:45.540
Shundou!

17:48.220 --> 17:49.460
Just made it...

17:50.310 --> 17:52.750
Oops, maybe I went a bit too far aru?

17:55.150 --> 17:58.770
But today, I took yet another step forward aru!

17:59.180 --> 18:02.260
This is why I can't stop training aru!

18:05.270 --> 18:06.520
What are you?

18:06.950 --> 18:10.040
Ah! There you are!

18:10.310 --> 18:13.160
Ku Fei-san! I've been searching for you!

18:14.650 --> 18:16.560
Oh! It's the plain ghost!

18:22.370 --> 18:26.170
That's mean, Ku Fei-san! Stupid, stupid, stupid!

18:26.170 --> 18:28.830
And here I was, searching so hard for you!

18:28.830 --> 18:30.830
I was joking. It was a joke aru!

18:30.830 --> 18:33.290
How've you been, Sayo-bou?

18:33.290 --> 18:34.340
Oh wait, you're dead...

18:34.340 --> 18:38.340
Good job finding me in this wide world!

18:38.340 --> 18:39.530
And all alone too!

18:39.530 --> 18:40.840
How did you manage that aru?

18:42.100 --> 18:44.270
A lot has happened, actually...

18:52.520 --> 18:53.770
<i>It's no good!</i>

18:54.000 --> 18:55.530
What's wrong, Boy?

18:55.530 --> 18:56.950
Is that it?

18:56.950 --> 18:58.720
It's only been a few hundred hours!

18:58.720 --> 18:59.950
<i>I can't win!</i>

19:02.960 --> 19:04.030
<i>No, that's wrong.</i>

19:04.580 --> 19:06.470
<i>This Master is my shadow.</i>

19:06.470 --> 19:10.090
<i>Winning here means to win against my own shadow!</i>

19:11.400 --> 19:12.450
<i>But...</i>

19:12.450 --> 19:14.120
<i>How do I win?</i>

19:19.340 --> 19:20.090
Cra-

19:23.470 --> 19:26.420
Magic Archer, Nine Arrows of Light!

19:23.470 --> 19:26.420
Sagitta Magica, Series Fulguralis!

19:27.040 --> 19:28.490
Lightning Blossom Crumbling Fist!

19:27.040 --> 19:28.490
Raika Houken!

19:46.740 --> 19:49.620
I'm surprised you could still move that much.

19:50.140 --> 19:55.090
In this Phantasmagoria where you can't sleep, escape or even die,

19:55.630 --> 20:00.050
for you to have endured this much shows magnificent strength of determination that is nearly miraculous.

20:00.800 --> 20:04.140
But even your soul should be approaching its limit.

20:05.010 --> 20:06.410
How many times has it been now?

20:06.410 --> 20:07.810
Seventy times?

20:08.100 --> 20:11.310
Will you be able to stand again after this, boy?

20:16.370 --> 20:18.060
Shit, again?!

20:18.060 --> 20:20.800
Hey old man! There aren't enough herbs!

20:20.800 --> 20:22.330
Give me some more!

20:22.330 --> 20:23.570
Alright.

20:23.950 --> 20:27.710
But you know Missy, you're quite impressive too.

20:28.240 --> 20:31.080
You've been nursing him for two days and nights without sleep.

20:31.080 --> 20:32.770
I don't have much of a choice!

20:33.100 --> 20:36.820
If anything happens to him, it's going to be partly my fault!

20:37.420 --> 20:40.700
Heck, how much longer is this going to continue?

20:40.700 --> 20:42.140
It's bad enough already!

20:42.730 --> 20:43.670
Yeah...

20:44.090 --> 20:48.930
Apart from his body, his soul must be rapidly approaching its limit.

20:48.930 --> 20:49.760
What?!

20:50.310 --> 20:55.700
In the Phantasmagoria that the kid is in, time flows many times faster than the real world.

20:56.490 --> 20:59.190
I estimate he's been fighting for over ten days by now.

21:00.040 --> 21:02.150
Normally, one would lose oneself in there.

21:02.630 --> 21:04.530
The kid's pretty amazing too.

21:05.970 --> 21:07.070
Ten days?

21:07.070 --> 21:08.150
Then...

21:08.150 --> 21:08.850
Yeah.

21:09.480 --> 21:16.190
At this rate, if the kid can't find a clue as to how to break down the Phantasmagoria, then he's a goner.

21:17.940 --> 21:23.040
As I told you, either he'll never wake up again or he'll become unable to use Magic.

21:23.490 --> 21:25.550
The limit should be around daybreak today.

21:26.980 --> 21:29.550
It would be better if you prepared yourself.

21:33.830 --> 21:35.180
Sensei...

21:36.630 --> 21:38.470
What, is that it?

21:39.780 --> 21:43.590
This will have severed both your path to Light and Darkness.

21:44.320 --> 21:45.470
Oh well...

21:45.470 --> 21:46.610
That's fine too.

21:47.430 --> 21:50.080
Being saved by your comrades and taken back home...

21:50.310 --> 21:52.290
Forgetting about your father...

21:52.290 --> 21:56.550
And living happily with everyone at that Academy isn't so bad either.

21:57.430 --> 22:00.530
You did good, boy.

22:03.230 --> 22:04.050
What?!

22:13.120 --> 22:14.620
Avalanche!

22:13.120 --> 22:14.620
Nivis Casus!

22:21.110 --> 22:22.030
This is good!

22:22.030 --> 22:23.330
Finally an even match!

22:23.330 --> 22:24.110
Take a good look!

22:24.110 --> 22:25.110
Savor it!

22:25.110 --> 22:26.360
Remember it well!

22:26.360 --> 22:28.970
<i>This</i>  is the true source of your power!

22:29.850 --> 22:31.260
Your initial impulses!

22:31.260 --> 22:32.890
Your first drive!

22:32.890 --> 22:34.540
Your true self!

22:34.860 --> 22:35.750
However...

22:36.800 --> 22:38.980
You can't win with just that.

22:38.980 --> 22:41.120
Too bad, boy.

22:42.230 --> 22:43.630
<i>She got me?</i>

22:43.630 --> 22:45.820
<i>Even this... wasn't enough?</i>

22:46.610 --> 22:48.240
<i>I guess that was obvious...</i>

22:48.240 --> 22:51.170
<i>There was no way could I beat Master...</i>

22:51.380 --> 22:52.920
<i>Negi, you idiot!</i>

22:54.910 --> 22:57.830
<i>You're just gonna let her say all that arrogant stuff?</i>

22:58.290 --> 23:00.610
<i>Are you just gonna give up there?</i>

23:01.070 --> 23:03.010
Lic Lac La Lac Lilac!

23:03.010 --> 23:07.440
Come, Spirits of Ice and Darkness!

23:03.010 --> 23:07.440
Veniant Spiritus Glaciales Obscurantes!

23:07.440 --> 23:11.760
O Snowstorm which Blows with Darkness!

23:07.440 --> 23:11.760
Cum Obscuratione Flet Tempestas Nivalis!

23:12.730 --> 23:16.390
<i>But Asuna-san... I already...</i>

23:16.600 --> 23:20.930
<i>Though you should have already realized what that means.</i>

23:22.970 --> 23:24.160
<i>I see...</i>

23:24.160 --> 23:26.160
<i>I do... I do know!</i>

23:26.160 --> 23:27.950
This is the end, boy!

23:27.950 --> 23:30.620
Snowstorm of Darkness!

23:27.950 --> 23:30.620
Nivis Tempestas Obscurans!

23:31.350 --> 23:35.570
<i>It was all within what everyone told me.</i>

23:35.570 --> 23:37.570
<i>If it's that much of a bother, just forget it!</i>

23:37.570 --> 23:39.570
<i>Hold it in your chest and move on.</i>

23:39.570 --> 23:44.650
<i>Even if the power came from hating someone or running away,</i>

23:44.650 --> 23:47.790
<i>that power is still your splendid power!</i>

23:47.790 --> 23:51.530
<i>Even if you're completely covered in mud, you must keep moving forward.</i>

23:53.470 --> 23:53.990
What?!

23:55.030 --> 23:56.390
<i>Magia Erebea...</i>

23:56.890 --> 23:58.120
<i>In other words, it's...</i>

24:01.650 --> 24:04.600
<i>Good and evil, strength and weakness...</i>

24:04.600 --> 24:08.000
<i>To accept everything as it is and consume it all!</i>

24:08.170 --> 24:10.170
Seize!

24:08.170 --> 24:10.170
Complexio!

24:10.170 --> 24:11.380
This is...

24:19.970 --> 24:21.560
Brilliant, boy!

24:21.560 --> 24:23.350
Magia Erebea...

24:23.350 --> 24:24.600
Do you understand it now?

24:25.020 --> 24:28.400
You are a shadow constructed from my memories.

24:28.950 --> 24:30.530
In other words, you're part of me.

24:30.990 --> 24:35.280
This trial wasn't about beating you, was it?

24:36.510 --> 24:38.430
It's taken you far too long.

24:38.430 --> 24:39.640
But fine.

24:40.390 --> 24:41.520
Show me...

24:43.090 --> 24:44.530
the results!

25:00.730 --> 25:01.820
Damn it...

25:01.820 --> 25:03.140
Still not done, Sensei?

25:03.990 --> 25:05.140
I can't wait anymore!

25:06.600 --> 25:07.900
The sun's coming up...

25:11.070 --> 25:14.250
<i>If you plan to cancel the effects of the scroll with the knife,</i>

25:14.790 --> 25:17.030
<i>do it before the sun rises.</i>

25:28.590 --> 25:29.740
I'm sorry, Sensei!

25:30.290 --> 25:33.800
I... I can't do it!

25:39.390 --> 25:40.940
<i>I'm sorry, Sensei...</i>

25:40.940 --> 25:43.310
<i>That I couldn't believe in you until the end...</i>

25:43.310 --> 25:48.140
<i>But as long as you are fine, there are plenty of other ways.</i>

25:53.070 --> 25:55.400
Good morning, Chisame-san.

25:57.500 --> 25:58.730
It's alright now.

26:02.780 --> 26:05.620
Huh? Are you alright, Chisame-san?

26:08.250 --> 26:11.490
If you're going to wake up, just get up!

26:11.490 --> 26:12.670
You stupid brat!

26:13.750 --> 26:17.940
You woke up at the very last moment as though you had an appointment!

26:17.940 --> 26:18.550
Idiot!

26:18.720 --> 26:20.390
Wai-! That's dange-!

26:20.390 --> 26:21.140
Chisame-sa-?

26:20.390 --> 26:23.690
You made me worry so much all for nothing!

26:23.690 --> 26:28.980
Wait, why does my body hurt all over?

26:28.200 --> 26:29.560
As if I would know!

26:30.100 --> 26:32.560
Oh, so you're awake, kid!

26:32.560 --> 26:33.440
Rakan-san!

26:40.410 --> 26:42.530
What's with that reaction, old man?!

26:43.670 --> 26:46.780
I waited two days to find out if he would live or die!

26:47.200 --> 26:50.860
Who wouldn't shed a few tears to find out he's fine?!

26:50.860 --> 26:51.920
Is it really that funny?!

26:54.280 --> 26:57.330
Oh yeah, kid. You should be grateful to Missy here.

26:57.940 --> 27:02.050
She nursed you for two days and two nights straight while you were on the verge of death, after all.

27:02.320 --> 27:04.050
Eh? Chisame-san did?

27:04.580 --> 27:06.710
Chisame-san! Thank you so mu-  Woah!

27:06.710 --> 27:08.270
Shut up!

27:08.270 --> 27:11.700
Don't think you can make up for all of that with mere gratitude!

27:11.700 --> 27:14.730
Kneel down and become my slave!

27:23.390 --> 27:25.780
In any case, good job, kid!

27:26.220 --> 27:29.200
With this, you're finally standing at the start line!

27:29.700 --> 27:31.670
Try concentrating your Magic in both arms.

27:32.130 --> 27:34.000
Both... arms?

27:38.160 --> 27:40.870
It's proof that you've grasped Eva's Dark Magic.

27:41.540 --> 27:46.160
A power only you have that you obtained by yourself.

27:46.160 --> 27:47.430
Be proud of it!

27:47.870 --> 27:50.920
<i>Proof that I grasped Master's technique...</i>

27:51.490 --> 27:52.920
However, don't relax just yet!

27:53.620 --> 27:57.600
All you've done is finally obtain your own special skill.

27:57.600 --> 27:59.030
Now comes the real training!

28:00.010 --> 28:00.760
Yes!

28:01.050 --> 28:03.770
Alright, let's get started then!

28:03.770 --> 28:05.140
Show me your stuff!

28:05.140 --> 28:05.780
Yes!

28:05.980 --> 28:09.240
Hey! Is it alright to start straight away?!

28:11.750 --> 28:14.500
Um... Chisame-san...

28:16.980 --> 28:20.260
Truly... thank you very much.

28:21.330 --> 28:24.080
There's no need for thanks.

28:26.820 --> 28:31.230
Wait! If you don't rest, it'll be bad, Sensei!

28:31.230 --> 28:33.230
It'll be fine!

28:33.900 --> 28:36.130
He's been sleeping for two days, after all.

28:36.130 --> 28:37.230
Right, kid?

28:38.220 --> 28:38.980
Yes!

28:39.410 --> 28:42.740
No, that's definitely wrong!

28:43.630 --> 28:47.180
At least let him bathe!

28:47.180 --> 28:48.810
Hey!
